<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: bioregeneration -->
  <Bioregeneration.label>生体递归</Bioregeneration.label>
  <!-- EN: Unlock the biosculpter pod's bioregeneration cycle. This cycle heals old scars, regenerates small lost body parts like fingers and toes, and cures many of the physical maladies that come with old age. -->
  <Bioregeneration.description>解锁塑形舱的生体递归周期。此周期可以治愈疤痕，修复类似手指之类的缺损的较小肢体部位，以及许多随着年龄增长而产生的疾病。</Bioregeneration.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->生物再生</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究爆炸羚鹿角再生，寻找与人类再生的类比</li>
    <li>subject_story->把蝾螈的基因数据拼接到[ANYPAWN_possessive]自己体内</li>
    <li>subject_story->在闪耀世界的医院接受过训练</li>
    <li>subject_story->修完了一门闪耀世界美学的函授课程</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->再生人体形态</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->用生物塑形器激活再生</li>
  -->
  <Bioregeneration.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->生体递归</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了爆炸羊角的再生和人类再生的相似性</li>
    <li>subject_story->将蝾螈的基因数据切片注入到[ANYPAWN_possessive]身上</li>
    <li>subject_story->在某个闪耀世界医院受训</li>
    <li>subject_story->完成了闪耀世界的美学函授课程</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->重塑了人体形态</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->激活了生体塑形仓的递归功能</li>
  </Bioregeneration.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: biosculpting -->
  <Biosculpting.label>生体塑形</Biosculpting.label>
  <!-- EN: Construct biosculpter pods which can perform various biological alterations to colonists. These are especially important to believers in transhumanism. -->
  <Biosculpting.description>建造生体塑形舱，可以对殖民者进行各种生物改造。这些对超人类主义的信徒来说特别重要。</Biosculpting.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->生物塑形</li>
    <li>subject_story->按合同为多个殖民地建造生物塑形舱</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究超人类主义信条，其中包括生物塑形的必要性</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究过哪些生物改造可以安全地进行</li>
    <li>subject_story->带着这些计划逃离了一座闪耀世界的供养农场</li>
    <li>subject_story->被一个超人类主义殖民地接纳</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造生物塑形舱</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->塑造人体形态</li>
  -->
  <Biosculpting.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->生体塑形</li>
    <li>subject_story->为多个殖民地的合同而建造生体塑形舱</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究技术融合戒律，包括生体塑形的必要性</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究何种生物改动可被安全利用。</li>
    <li>subject_story->带着这些设计图逃离了一个闪耀世界支持农场</li>
    <li>subject_story->被邀请加入了一个超人类主义者殖民地</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造了生体塑形舱</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->塑造人体</li>
  </Biosculpting.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: neural supercharger -->
  <NeuralSupercharger.label>神经超频</NeuralSupercharger.label>
  <!-- EN: Construct neural supercharger devices. Neural superchargers improve consciousness and learning rate, but they also increase hunger and the effect must be refreshed daily. Transhumanists often hold neural supercharging as an important practice. -->
  <NeuralSupercharger.description>构建神经超频装置。神经超频可以提高意识和学习效率，但也会增加饥饿速度，而且必须每天刷新效果。超人类主义者通常将神经超频作为一项重要的实践。</NeuralSupercharger.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->神经增压器</li>
    <li>subject_story->在[ANYPAWN_possessive]寄宿学校推行了神经增压器</li>
    <li>subject_story->给养殖克隆体的神经元增压，大幅加速其发育</li>
    <li>subject_story->试图在[ANYPAWN_pronoun]所教的大学课程里禁用神经增压</li>
    <li>subject_story->加入了一个强制使用神经增压的超人类主义教派</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->给人的智力增压</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造神经增压器</li>
  -->
  <NeuralSupercharger.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->神经超频器</li>
    <li>subject_story->在[ANYPAWN_possessive]寄宿学校内实施了神经超频</li>
    <li>subject_story->超频了农场中批量克隆人的神经以加速其成长</li>
    <li>subject_story->试图在[ANYPAWN_pronoun]教授的大学课程中禁止神经超频</li>
    <li>subject_story->加入了一个超人类主义教派，该教派将神经超频作为必须活动。</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->超频一个人类的智能</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造了神经超频器</li>
  </NeuralSupercharger.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
</LanguageData>